<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00304">
	<title>Charging door</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>charging electric vehicle 
					<indexterm>charging door</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<section id="e01352">
			<title>Opening Charging door</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01353">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01354">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q038.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<sectiondiv><ph>Operation</ph>
			</sectiondiv>
			<ol id="e01355">
				<li>
					<p>Press the center edge of the charging door.</p>
					<p importance="default">The charging door will not open if the vehicle doors are locked.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Pull the charging door fully open towards the front of the vehicle.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
		<section id="e01356">
			<title>Closing Charging door</title>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01357">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01358">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q039.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<sectiondiv><ph>Operation</ph>
			</sectiondiv>
			<ol id="e01359">
				<li>
					<p>Close the charging door and press it lightly to ensure it returns to its original position. Verify that it is securely closed.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>